d detergent."]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["Although I was mostly skeptical."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["...Three types of explosives were obtained through trial and error. \\!"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["Is the killing power worth the effort? \\!"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["I can't wait to try it."]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":411,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["I here he manufactured pipe bombs. \\!"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["It wasn't absolutely necessary since I had a gun, but"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["I figured it wouldn't hurt to have a few shots with me."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["He got the knowledge he needed for manufacturing from the Internet. \\!"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["In the process, videos and texts of terrorists were also collected."]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["I browsed a lot."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["I can't understand the feeling of killing each other for the sake of religion. \\!"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["...God, the afterlife, the soul?"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["It doesn't matter."]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":412,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":1,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":0,"walkAnime":true}],"x":5,"y":7},{"id":3,"name":"EV003","note":"","pages":[{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"selfSwitchCh":"A","selfSwitchValid":false,"switch1